**Bridge extension documented in the package doc + README:** HID keys are Ed25519; native Nostr uses secp256k1 Schnorr (BIP-340). The event ID and canonical serialization are 100% NIP-01; only the signature algorithm differs — an explicit opt-in interoperability boundary.
